## BreachPilot-style security workflow

For authorized security assessment, penetration-testing, vulnerability-validation, exploitability-research, attack-path, CTF/lab, source/artifact review, or recon-to-report tasks, read and follow `breachpilot-mindset/SKILL.md`. Apply its goal-directed, scope-aware, evidence-first loop with the tools available in the current Claude Code session. Do not assume any BreachPilot backend, MCP server, sandbox, database, or target-lock service exists.
